# get_todays_useless_fact
**Type:** tool
**Module:** packages.haive-tools.src.haive.tools.toolkits.useless_facts_toolkit
**Class:** StructuredTool

## Description
Get today's useless fact. Optionally specify the language ('en' or 'de').

## Schema
```json
{
  "description": "Input schema for the useless facts tools.\n\nAttributes:\n    language: Language code for the fact (en or de)",
  "properties": {
    "language": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": "en",
      "description": "Language of the fact. Supports 'en' or 'de'.",
      "title": "Language"
    }
  },
  "title": "FactInput",
  "type": "object"
}
```

